    {
      "type": "note",
      "id": "UHgrg",
      "x": 620,
      "y": 480,
      "name": "fn",
      "width": 520,
      "height": 340,
      "content": "State Machine Flow:\n\n场景 A（新项目）:\nProjectSetupCard Done → AutoChain Notice → ProgressPill → SummaryCard\n（无需用户确认，自动衔接）\n\n场景 B（老用户进入已有但未索引的项目）:\nBootstrapPromptCard → 用户点击「开始扫描」→ ProgressPill → SummaryCard\n用户点击「稍后再说」→ snooze 7天 → 7天后再次提示\n\n场景 C（升级发现）:\nMemoryHub Index Status 新增「重建索引」按钮\n+ 一次性 banner 提示新功能可用\n\nindex_state 五态:\nmissing → building → ready\nmissing → building → failed\nready → stale → building → ready\n\n非阻塞设计：\n- ProgressPill 默认收起，不遮挡对话\n- 点击展开查看详细阶段\n- 扫描完成自动展开 SummaryCard"
    }
  ]
